      "value": "@{6b08268ef82b66a8e50e6e61|full_name} Previously in VRChat 2026.4.1p3 (Build `1939`), clicking on a world thumbnail absolutely creates a new Public instance if no public instance is available.\n\nSee the attached video and logs.\n\n```\n\n2026.11.26 13:10:27 Debug      -  [API] POST initiated for destination \n\n2026.11.26 13:10:27 Debug      -  [API] Creating world instance \n\n{  worldId: wrld_60809368-e953-4d33-8026-191c1f8a3f5d,\n\n  type: public,\n\n  region: eu,\n\n  ageGate: False,\n\n  ownerId: usr_6fa4abc5-9952-4a0a-97de-b3598fbf6a5c,\n\n  playerPersistenceEnabled: True,\n\n  minimumAvatarPerformance: null}\n\n2026.11.26 13:10:27 Debug      -  [API] Requesting Post instances {{\"worldId\":\"wrld_60809368-e953-4d33-8026-191c1f8a3f5d\", \"type\":\"public\", \"region\":\"eu\", \"ageGate\":false, \"ownerId\":\"usr_6fa4abc5-9952-4a0a-97de-b3598fbf6a5c\", \"playerPersistenceEnabled\":true, \"minimumAvatarPerformance\":\"None\"}} retryCount: 2\n\n2026.11.26 13:10:27 Debug      -  [API] [276] Sending Post request to https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/instances\n\n2026.11.26 13:10:27 Debug      -  [API] Post request for wrld_60809368-e953-4d33-8026-191c1f8a3f5d:89562~region(eu) completed\n\n```",
