      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}\n\nThank you for your response.\n\nI've recorded a video showing the issue on my end.\n\nAs you can see in the video, when I click on a world thumbnail to open its details page, a new Public instance is automatically created, and I become the instance owner.\n\nI do not click \"New Instance\" or \"Join\". Simply opening the world details page causes this to happen.\n\nThis happens with multiple different worlds.\n\nI understand that a Public instance may be automatically created when no other Public instances are available.\n\nHowever, in my case, a new instance appears to be created with me as the owner.\n\nCould you please check whether this is intended behavior?\n\nSorry for the poor video quality.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
