      "value": "@{6b08268ef82b66a8e50e6e61|full_name} That behavior seems correct to me and intended. I was refuting your claim \"this behavior did not occur in previous versions of VRChat\".\n\nSee \"Public Instance Ownership\" from the [VRChat 2026.4.2](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202642#public-instance-ownership) release notes.",
