      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name}\n\nThank you for the clarification and for pointing me to the release notes.\n\nAs I understand it, the following two behaviors are working together:\n\n* Even in previous versions, opening the details page of a world with no available Public instances would automatically create a new Public instance.\n\n* Since the release of VRChat 2026.4.2, the user who creates a Public instance is designated as its instance owner.\n\nAs a result, when I open the details page of a world with no available Public instances, a new Public instance is created with me as the owner.\n\nI now understand that this is not a bug, but the expected behavior resulting from these two features working together.\n\nThank you for taking the time to explain this and help me understand the changes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
